{"resourceIdentifier":"5498","resourceName":"Hedong Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"The project locates in Pengfang Village, Luoshi Township, Fengcheng City, Yichun City, Jiangxi Province, P.R China.  The project is to build a centralized anaerobic animal manure treatment system which collects manure waste of swine from the multiple hog farms in the Fengcheng City. The project uses animal manure waste as ferment material to produce biogas in two Completely Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters. The recovered biogas is used for electricity generation, or flared in case biogas generators are not available or under maintenance. Two generators with an installed capacity of 1.2 MW have been installed in the biogas power plant. The residual waste from the CSTR digesters is used in nearby farmlands by aerobic treatment. The project is designed to collect 365,000 tons of manure annually and generate 7,300,000 m3 of biogas annually. The project is estimated to generate 14,600 MWh annually. In addition, all of the electricity generated from the biogas is delivered to CCPG. Waste heat recovery boiler will also be installed at the biogas power plant to recover and supply waste heat to the auxiliary equipment of the project. For conservativeness, the emission reductions from electricity generation and generator waste heat recovery will not be accounted for.","location":{"latitude":27.956495,"longitude":115.811261},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-04-08","endExclusive":"2025-05-09","endInclusive":"2025-05-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5498"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fengcheng Xinfengtai Environment Technology Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Province, China"}]